 "description": "Hazen Lab colloidal-borescope groundwater flow vectors in SSO wells M4, M5 and L9 (screens SZ1-SZ3, 1-ft steps), 31 January to 26 February 2024: flow azimuth and velocity with direction and speed statistics for 39 attempted measurements",
